# Surfaces the ACTUAL top holdings of the owner's ETFs (Samsung, SK Hynix, TSMC, the STAR-50
# names, US semis) with per-holding analyst rating + 12-mo target + upside + next-quarter EPS,
# plus per-holding / exchange / theme news. Zacks only rates US stocks, so foreign holdings get
# the SAME FactSet analyst consensus TradingView already serves the US overlay -- extended to the
# local Asian lines (TWSE / KRX / SSE) via a per-market symbol scan. TV serves next-quarter EPS
# + 12-mo price target only (no FQ+2/FQ+3), so the forward read is 3-mo EPS + 12-mo target/upside;
# a coverage PROBE logs, per holding, exactly what resolved so the render is built on confirmed
# data (never fabricated -> '—' where a source/line genuinely returns nothing).

