# metrics all of them, let tce be independent"). STORY-FIRST layer, fully independent of
# the frozen TCE conviction engine: THEME-level Google News queries (policy/tariff/AI/
# rates/... -- stories that never name a ticker, the Trump-news-for-DELL gap) are fetched
# through the SAME proven _fetch_rss_entries plumbing TCE news uses, classified rule-based
# (event bucket + sentiment polarity + source-reliability tier), then mapped onto the
# dashboard's own watch universe by sector exposure + explicit exposure lists. The tab
# JUDGES each affected stock through the FULL explosive lens -- the index joins tickers
# to their existing explosive/pink records (all metrics already computed; zero rescoring).
# Also fuses the two highest-reliability feeds already collected every run: SEC 8-K
# material events + insider events. Keep-last-good on total fetch failure.
